(7669213, 1251122, 60581, '<td valign="top">nice and very slow shutter speed such a way that it doesn''t feel like camera is panning as what I can see words on the wall but at the same time bike rider shows the movement with no feet touching the ground. Nice work!</td>', 'nice and very slow shutter speed such a way that it doesn''t feel like camera is panning as what I can see words on the wall but at the same time bike rider shows the movement with no feet touching the ground. Nice work!', '2020-07-09 17:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7669214, 1251396, 60581, '<td valign="top">I guess need a steady hand and smooth movement, I think you should have bumped the shutter speed a few points as there was no harm in doing that and car would have come a bit sharp.</td>', 'I guess need a steady hand and smooth movement, I think you should have bumped the shutter speed a few points as there was no harm in doing that and car would have come a bit sharp.', '2020-07-09 17:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7669215, 1251091, 60581, '<td valign="top">I see this on top though I consider as motion panning and there is argument with that as what to consider motion panning vs Panning the camera :D nice to see Ribbon though :)</td>', 'I see this on top though I consider as motion panning and there is argument with that as what to consider motion panning vs Panning the camera :D nice to see Ribbon though :)', '2020-07-09 17:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
